    <div class="divider-line"></div>
    <p class="quote">"Expect Nothing, Appreciate Everything."</p>

    <div class="contact-details">
        <span>📍 Alamada, North Cotabato</span>
        <span> ID Number 24-0752</span>
        <span>✉ jonnahonaleb@gmail.com</span>
        <span>📞 09639293388</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-number">15</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Following</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-number">5,000</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Followers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-number">560</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Friends</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-number">10</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Projects</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="section-card">
            <h3 class="section-title">👋 About Me</h3>
            <p class="section-text">
                Im Jonnah Mae Cabaya Belano, a 3rd year Student of Southern Christian College. Taking Bachelor of Science in Information Technology.
